IES: KONARK 32 WEST VIEW BORIVALI WEST\n\n### Project ratings\n\n4.4\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ☆\n\nBuilding\n\n9.2\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nLocation\n\n8.8\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nAmenities\n\n8.7\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nLegal\n\n8.9\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nValue for Money\n\n## Konark Developers\n\n**Developer:** [Konark Developers](/projects-in-konark-developers)\n\n### Other projects by Konark Developers\n\n[Konark Elegance J-24, Kandivali West](/project/konark-elegance-j-24-kandivali-west/33794)[Konark Elegance, Kandivali West](/project/konark-elegance-kandivali-west/33235)[Girnar Apartment, Borivali West](/project/girnar-apartment-borivali-west/33117)[Konark Ganga Niwas CHS , Vile Parle East](/project/konark-ganga-niwas-chs-vile-parle-east/33100)[Konark Vaayu, Goregaon West](/project/konark-vaayu-goregaon-west/31909)[Shanti Kishan , Dahisar East](/project/shanti-kishan-dahisar-east/30396)\n\n[Browse all projects in Borivali West →](/projects-in-borivali-west)\n\n## 📸 Project Gallery (3 images)\n\n![Main Image](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/33118/33118-main.webp?width=400&height=300&mode=crop&anchor=topcenter)\n\nMain Image\n\n![66](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/33118/66.webp?width=400&height=300&mode=crop&anchor=topcenter)\n\n66\n\n![Site Plan](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/33118/33118-plan.webp?width=400&height=300&mode=crop&anchor=topcenter)\n\nSite Plan\n\n## 🏊 Amenities & Features (17 amenities)\n\nCommon (9)\n\n🏢 Balcony🏋️ Gymnasium🏢 High speed elevators🎮 Indoor Games🏃 Jogging Track🧒 Kid's play area🌳 Landscaped garden⚡ Power Backup🏊 Swimming Pool\n\nInterior (6)\n\n🏠 Aluminium Sliding Windows🔧 Concealed Plumbing🔌 Concealed Wiring🏠 Intercom/CCTV🏠 POP finished walls🏠 Vitrified flooring\n\nKitchen (1)\n\n🪨 Granite Platform\n\nSpecial (1)\n\n🛡️ Security Help Desk\n\n## Floor plans & site plans\n\n🔒 Share your details to receive floor plans directly on WhatsApp.\n\n![Site Plan](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17a