isting property to fund this?\n\n✅ Perfect — our advisor has what they need.\n\nWe use cookies to improve your experience.\n\n👋 Looking for the right project? Let me help you find it!\n\nMPE Project Advisor\n\n● Online now","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/3-bhk-flats-in-borivali-west-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs","title":"3 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai - MagicBricks","raw_content":"# 3 BHK Flats in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Buy 3 BHK Flat in Borivali West Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnzVE88E9dMwsaJNNVppblwIgIFYwYVJR/Photo_h180_w240/75709519_1_PropertyImage1668170317801_180_240.jpg \"Buy 3 BHK Flat in Borivali West Mumbai\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nThis ready to move-in 3 BHK flat is available for sale at the premium Borivali West locality in Mumbai.This flat is placed in a premium location within Prasham Vishal 2. This ready to move flat located in Borivali West is available at the price of ₹2.60 Cr. Located on 4 floor, this apartment offers carpet area of 628 sqft. This residence offers power back up, reserved parking, security, intercom facility. The project is RERA approved and P51800016704 is the RERA number of the society. The address of this 3 BHK apartment is 6RGW+22M, Amarkant Jha Rd, Rameshwar Darshan CHS, Kastur Park, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/3-BHK-872-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Borivali-West-in-Mumbai&id=4d423735373039353139)\n\n![Buy 3 BHK Flat in Borivali West Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnzVE88E9dM_BhmyJqlls6lUvwfTXnsZw/Photo_h180_w240/75702823_1_PropertyImage1668677717439_180_240.jpg \"Buy 3 BHK Flat in Borivali West Mumbai\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nThis ready to move-in 3 BHK flat is available for sale at the premium Borivali West locality in Mumbai.Being located in Casa Castello, the proper